---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Property Record Review & Setup" description="Audit your existing property records and establish a compliant documentation system.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/services/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Services</a>

      <h1>Property Record Review & Setup</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Audit your existing property records and set up a compliant documentation system for leases, tenants, payments, and notices.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Why You Need This Service</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">Many landlords don't have a system for organizing property records. Documents are scattered — some in a drawer, some on phone notes, some lost. When you need to find a lease or prove something happened, you can't.</p>
        <p style="line-height:1.8; margin-top:1rem;"><strong>This service creates order.</strong> We:</p>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8; margin:1.5rem 0;">
          <li>Audit what you currently have and what's missing</li>
          <li>Design a system for organizing property records</li>
          <li>Create templates for documents you need going forward</li>
          <li>Show you how to maintain the system</li>
          <li>Give you tools to stay compliant</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;"><strong>From chaos to clarity, in one project.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What We Review & Set Up</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Existing Records:</strong> Gather what you have on each property and tenant</li>
          <li><strong>Gaps Analysis:</strong> What's missing or incomplete</li>
          <li><strong>Organization System:</strong> Folder structure (physical or digital) for all documents</li>
          <li><strong>Tenant File:</strong> What should be in each tenant's file</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Records:</strong> How to track and document rent received</li>
          <li><strong>Lease Register:</strong> Master list of all leases with key dates</li>
          <li><strong>Notice System:</strong> How to document notices served to tenants</li>
          <li><strong>Maintenance Log:</strong> Tracking repairs and tenant requests</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What You Get</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Audit Report:</strong> What you have, what's missing, what's at risk</li>
          <li><strong>Organization Plan:</strong> Physical/digital system design for your records</li>
          <li><strong>Document Templates:</strong> Lease register, tenant file checklist, payment log</li>
          <li><strong>Procedure Manual:</strong> Step-by-step how to maintain the system</li>
          <li><strong>Compliance Checklist:</strong> What to collect and keep for each tenant</li>
          <li><strong>Training:</strong> How to use the system going forward</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">When You Need This Service</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>You manage multiple properties and documents are disorganized</li>
          <li>You're taking over management from someone else</li>
          <li>You can't easily find tenant information when you need it</li>
          <li>You've had disputes and realized your records are weak</li>
          <li>You want to be ready if Rent Control asks for documentation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#e8f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">The Payoff</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">Clean, organized records take a few hours to set up but save you days of searching, mistakes, and disputes. If you ever need to prove something in Rent Control, this system is your advantage.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Pricing & Turnaround</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:0;">GHS 300 – 700</p>
        <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Depends on number of properties and volume of existing records</p>
        <p style="font-weight:600; margin-top:1rem;">Turnaround: 2–5 working days</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/services/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; margin-right:1rem;">Request a Quote</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/233208071633" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#f0f4f8; color:#516784; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid #516784;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
